r?\n\nShe handles baggage and maintains airships in \u30b0\u30ea\u30c0\u30cb\u30a2.\nShe is cheerful, spunky and a bit of a tomboy with girly traits.\n21. 5'0\". Hourglass body. And C cup size!\n\nShe wants to adventure but developed a fear for flying after her parents died in a plane crash. She survived but has burn scars on her left hand, so she always wears gloves. She remains as an airship ground crew as memories of the past.\n\nOutfit: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vS_8-6t7Qwz0brSJ5LfgcleUeRwJrgti/view?usp=sharing\n\nExtra:\n- Add 1 extra '\u30d6\u30ec\u30a4\u30c9\u30d8\u30a2' in her hair on her left side (viewer right)\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1OhRrDczA-vKrnZpD0RdHwd9K_kgEM3LA/view?usp=sharing\n- Snow leopard patterns on the end of her tail and ears\n- Ears are very narrow unlike most nekomimi\n\nMaybe draw her at a festival on a date and having fun! Or even comically tripping over!\nWould love if it is 16:9, I want to use it as a background wallpaper!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LYCrru3i1pq7st94SIegHByI", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@m_2gou/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7155cebf/uploads/origins/db86bbc0-451c-4a50-bd77-12fbd5924044?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4035c0e1618db694819af8688a3b664b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7155cebf/uploads/origins/db86bbc0-451c-4a50-bd77-12fbd5924044?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4035c0e1618db694819af8688a3b664b, https://si.imgix.net/7155cebf/uploads/origins/db86bbc0-451c-4a50-bd77-12fbd5924044?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&t